        "_acceptance/mobile-telemetry-runtime/resource-full-landscape844-overview.png",
        "_acceptance/mobile-telemetry-runtime/interfaces-down-landscape844-overview.png",
        "src/panel-framework/mobile-telemetry/MobileTelemetryBriefing.tsx",
        "src/panel-framework/mobile-telemetry/styles/telemetry-tablet-workbench.css",
        "src/panel-framework/mobile/mobile-entry.css"
      ],
      "action": "Add a short-height landscape composition rather than relying only on width breakpoints: keep the selected highest-priority object and its minimum evidence/action visible with the tab bar, or deliberately use the compact phone presentation. Preserve instant, interruptible control feedback and the existing reduced-motion behavior; do not solve this with animated rearrangement or decorative material. Re-capture and independently inspect every 667x390 and 844x390 scenario."
    },
    {
      "id": "phone-tablet-material-hierarchy-and-feedback",
      "result": "pass",
      "summary": "Phone 320/390/430 and tablet 768/1199 originals maintain a restrained cool material palette, compact object/status density, clear incident weight, readable numeric typography and bounded read-only actions. The source limits feedback to short transform/color transitions, provides active states and disables them under reduced motion; no decorative telemetry animation was found."
    }
